# Build And Release

## Constraints

- Preserve Expo-managed workflow unless explicitly asked otherwise
- Install expectation: `npm install --legacy-peer-deps`; `patch-package` patches are intentional
- Do not casually upgrade Expo, RN, React, Reanimated, or EAS config
- Treat bundle ID, package name, runtime version, and build numbers as human-gated

## Environment

- Align with Supabase env-var configuration (`EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL`, `EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`)
- Never hardcode secrets or credential material into source/docs

## Verification

- Confirm script names/paths against the repo before documenting them
- Prefer targeted validation over full platform builds unless asked
